{"id":"n71334-2-7","stage":0,"title":"편하다 · 方便","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n71334-2-7-1","ko":"할머니, 요즘 책을 많이 읽으시네요?","zh":"奶奶，您最近读的书真多啊？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"할머니,","meaning":"奶奶，姥姥","explanation":"할머니：奶奶，姥姥","readings":[{"term":"할머니","audio":"/audio/8dc4d6918deb0b6e1d10.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27375","senseId":"1","lemma":"할머니","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"요즘","meaning":"最近，近来，这阵子","explanation":"요즘：最近，近来，这阵子","readings":[{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20250","senseId":"1","lemma":"요즘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"책을","meaning":"书，书籍，画册","explanation":"책：书，书籍，画册；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"책","audio":"/audio/ba928dd573a2db9e7579.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71468","senseId":"1","lemma":"책","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"많이","meaning":"多","explanation":"많이：多","readings":[{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66030","senseId":"1","lemma":"많이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"읽으시네요?","meaning":"阅读","explanation":"읽다：阅读；으시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"읽다","audio":"/audio/f843025cff483034e05a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68752","senseId":"2","lemma":"읽다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"8dc4d6918deb0b6e","term":"할머니","zh":"奶奶，姥姥","audio":"/audio/8dc4d6918deb0b6e1d10.mp3","entryId":"27375","definition":"用于指称或称呼父亲的母亲或母亲的母亲。","pronunciation":["할머니"]},{"id":"828c4030dd68aa7b","term":"요즘","zh":"最近，近来，这阵子","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3","entryId":"20250","definition":"从非常近的过去到现在之间。","pronunciation":["요즘"]},{"id":"ba928dd573a2db9e","term":"책","zh":"书，书籍，画册","audio":"/audio/ba928dd573a2db9e7579.mp3","entryId":"71468","definition":"把文章或画印刷之后装订成册而成的物品。","pronunciation":["책"]},{"id":"1af2aeb1be04021c","term":"많이","zh":"多","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3","entryId":"66030","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准地。","pronunciation":["마ː니"]},{"id":"f843025cff483034","term":"읽다","zh":"阅读","audio":"/audio/f843025cff483034e05a.mp3","entryId":"68752","definition":"看文字了解其意思。","pronunciation":["익따"]}],"audio":"/audio/c018fe9c3f72ec88441b.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n71334-2-7-2","ko":"이 책들이 글씨가 커서 읽기에 편하구나.","zh":"这些书的字很大，读起来真方便呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이：这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27527","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"책들이","meaning":"书，书籍，画册","explanation":"책：书，书籍，画册；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"책","audio":"/audio/ba928dd573a2db9e7579.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71468","senseId":"1","lemma":"책","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"글씨가","meaning":"字体，字迹，笔迹","explanation":"글씨：字体，字迹，笔迹；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"글씨","audio":"/audio/510fc81ede633cdb436d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60239","senseId":"1","lemma":"글씨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"커서","meaning":"大，高，长，壮阔","explanation":"크다：大，高，长，壮阔；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"크다","audio":"/audio/d9eb2cf86baea9292578.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66586","senseId":"1","lemma":"크다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"읽기에","meaning":"阅读","explanation":"읽다：阅读；기：将前面的动作或状态转成名词性表达。；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"읽다","audio":"/audio/f843025cff483034e05a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68752","senseId":"2","lemma":"읽다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"편하구나.","meaning":"方便","explanation":"편하다：方便；구나：对新发现或新理解的情况表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"편하다","audio":"/audio/33bf1e37d2739b22abdd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71334","senseId":"2","lemma":"편하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio